  "description": "<p>This Christian-themed area rug offers a unique blend of spiritual inspiration and home décor. Featuring a faith-based floral design, it provides a comfortable and non-slip surface, perfect for enhancing various indoor spaces with both style and meaning.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features a faith-based floral design for spiritual inspiration.</li>\n<li>Soft polyester fabric ensures a comfortable feel underfoot.</li>\n<li>Anti-slip backing provides enhanced safety and stability.</li>\n<li>Machine washable for easy and thorough cleaning.</li>\n<li>Can be personalized with a name or special message.</li>\n<li>Suitable for a wide range of indoor settings and uses.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form Type</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Non-Skid</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Floral</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Faith</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Traditional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance Level</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Cotton Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Vacuum for quick cleaning or machine wash for deeper care.</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile rug is ideal for entryways, bedrooms, living rooms, and offices. It also serves beautifully as a prayer rug, meditation corner rug, or a decorative piece in a church setting.</p>",
